  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Two particles having de-Broglie wavelengths&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>λ</mi> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo></mrow> </msub> </mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>λ</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>,&nbsp;while&nbsp;moving along mutually perpendicular directions, undergo perfectly inelastic collision. The de-Broglie wavelength&nbsp;<math> <mi>λ</mi> </math>, of the final particle is</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
